      "en": "“You shall have no other gods before me.",
      "ko": "너는 나 외에는 다른 신들을 네게 있게 말찌니라",
      "source_text_hash": "b83afeb8091631e55436b6d33885c3879211112d01dffc5e8b56e5976bc53f65",
      "translation_text_hash": "e32a204bac12c7ec1e3092b061b00c03bf2cd460f2b8b5bd56203cc82f79add8",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
