      "en": "“Remember the Sabbath day, to keep it holy.",
      "ko": "안식일을 기억하여 거룩히 지키라",
      "source_text_hash": "d19a94bf88cb6a422decbec97c097c41ec734e7803c38475fac632318a4d9aa1",
