      "en": "You shall labor six days, and do all your work,",
      "ko": "엿새 동안은 힘써 네 모든 일을 행할 것이나",
      "source_text_hash": "8c90eab3c1be58f79125710672e54cc1f4ff14b3b911ae920b45d3ee5b1e4f99",
      "translation_text_hash": "1622ce55de004fb6b17d3d9e32a9e960eb179cad497b5a97491a9d51dd95fefe",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
